# WN22-00-000280: Windows Server 2022 must have a host-based firewall installed and enabled.
# Source: Windows Server 2022 STIG r8
# Severity: medium
# Generated from 01-extract/output/windows-server-2022-stig-r8-controls.json

META
    esp_id `win2022-wn22-00-000280-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `windows`
    criticality `high`

    title `Windows Server 2022 must have a host-based firewall installed and enabled.`
    description `A firewall provides a line of defense against attack, allowing or blocking inbound and outbound connections based on a set of rules. Satisfies: SRG-OS-000480-GPOS-00227, SRG-OS-000480-GPOS-00232`
    author `scanset-security`
    tags `windows,server-2022,stig,medium,firewall,network,ksi-cmt-lmc,ksi-cmt-rmv,ksi-mla-evc,ksi-svc-acm`

    control_mapping `KSI:KSI-CMT-LMC,KSI:KSI-CMT-RMV,KSI:KSI-MLA-EVC,KSI:KSI-SVC-ACM,NIST-800-53:CM-6`
    control_objective `KSI-CMT-LMC,KSI-CMT-RMV,KSI-MLA-EVC,KSI-SVC-ACM`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Windows:server-2022:endpoint`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Install and enable a host-based firewall on the system.`

    component_id `comp-windows-firewall-profile`

    impl_KSI_CMT_LMC `Windows Server implements KSI-CMT-LMC by enforcing Windows Defender Firewall state across profiles [Domain, Private, Public]. The ESP scanner queries state via the windows_firewall_profile CTN and fails the policy if the observed value does not match. Remediation: Enable the firewall per profile via Set-NetFirewallProfile or Group Policy.`
    impl_KSI_CMT_RMV `Windows Server implements KSI-CMT-RMV by enforcing Windows Defender Firewall state across profiles [Domain, Private, Public]. The ESP scanner queries state via the windows_firewall_profile CTN and fails the policy if the observed value does not match. Remediation: Enable the firewall per profile via Set-NetFirewallProfile or Group Policy.`
    impl_KSI_MLA_EVC `Windows Server implements KSI-MLA-EVC by enforcing Windows Defender Firewall state across profiles [Domain, Private, Public]. The ESP scanner queries state via the windows_firewall_profile CTN and fails the policy if the observed value does not match. Remediation: Enable the firewall per profile via Set-NetFirewallProfile or Group Policy.`
    impl_KSI_SVC_ACM `Windows Server implements KSI-SVC-ACM by enforcing Windows Defender Firewall state across profiles [Domain, Private, Public]. The ESP scanner queries state via the windows_firewall_profile CTN and fails the policy if the observed value does not match. Remediation: Enable the firewall per profile via Set-NetFirewallProfile or Group Policy.`
    impl_CM_6 `Windows Server implements CM-6 by enforcing Windows Defender Firewall state across profiles [Domain, Private, Public]. The ESP scanner queries state via the windows_firewall_profile CTN and fails the policy if the observed value does not match. Remediation: Enable the firewall per profile via Set-NetFirewallProfile or Group Policy.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target_domain
        name `Domain`
    OBJECT_END
    OBJECT target_private
        name `Private`
    OBJECT_END
    OBJECT target_public
        name `Public`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE compliant_domain
        exists boolean = true
        enabled boolean = true
    STATE_END
    STATE compliant_private
        exists boolean = true
        enabled boolean = true
    STATE_END
    STATE compliant_public
        exists boolean = true
        enabled boolean = true
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN windows_firewall_profile
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF compliant_domain
            OBJECT_REF target_domain
        CTN_END
        CTN windows_firewall_profile
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF compliant_private
            OBJECT_REF target_private
        CTN_END
        CTN windows_firewall_profile
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF compliant_public
            OBJECT_REF target_public
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
